  "label": "Stroke Patient is mapped to Primal Reaction Scene",
  "description": "The text 'when you ask the stroke patient to smile' is mapped onto the visual of the Black woman's primal reaction. The meme implies that asking a stroke patient to smile results in the exaggerated, animalistic expression shown, thereby equating the medical condition with a primal, aggressive response. This mapping is harmful as it uses a real medical scenario to reinforce racist stereotypes about Black people being inherently primal or aggressive.",
